  (text "Circuit: AND!XOR's DC27 'MCP23017 16 GPIO Reference Design' rev1 (2019-03-15, Apache-2.0), read from the maker's schematic picture. Layout and artwork: SAO++." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5779853d-6b14-5994-b486-79de8bcc63f8"))
  (text "Badge power only (recorded exception to the SAO++ power switch): J1 pin 1 feeds the chip directly, as on the maker's design. There is no coin cell on this board." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e1b4fcf8-6222-5336-b378-e45721b1b699"))
  (text "A0 = A1 = A2 = GND: 7-bit I2C address 0x20.  RESET tied to 3.3 V.  INTA, INTB, pins 11 and 14 unconnected (as the maker's).  No I2C pull-ups on the add-on." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2df874ff-6b7b-5aef-ba07-93a7c7c03d43"))
  (text "Each output drives one red through-board LED to GND when HIGH. Resistors 1.3k (maker: 1k): about 1.1 mA per LED, about 19 mA with all 16 lit." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4b40b0cc-852b-5395-9973-675eb499f5e2"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
